homelab-domain-admin (0.1.35) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v0.1.35

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Fri, 02 Oct 2026 22:35:37 -0500

homelab-domain-admin (0.1.35) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Catch-all routing: set_catchall now accepts send_enabled, so a
    domain catch-all can be set to SEND AS <anyone>@<domain> (not just
    receive) -- preserved on a plain destination change. list_catchalls
    returns send_enabled + has_dkim. The catch-all handlers
    (list/get/set/clear) are now gated by site_admin OR the new
    domains.catchall capability (new authenticated_email_with_capability
    helper), so a granted group can run catch-all routing without full
    site_admin.

 -- Jeff Gardner <mailmasker-api01@forge.name>  Wed, 01 Oct 2026 09:00:00 -0500

