homelab-domain-admin (0.1.34) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v0.1.33

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 09:55:01 -0500

homelab-domain-admin (0.1.33) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Drop the install-time HAProxy/PowerDNS PUSH -- registration is now PULL:
    ct00 (homelab-haproxy discover:) + ct18 (homelab-dns-pull) derive the
    signer set from homelab-api and self-configure, so a signer install no
    longer pushes to (or waits on SSH to) ct00/ct18. The local nftables.d
    drop-in + config/KEK/VIP automation stay. Helpers remain in
    homelab-common for manual use.

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 09:55:01 -0500

