  * Release v0.1.32

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 08:52:36 -0500

homelab-domain-admin (0.1.32) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v0.1.31

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 08:49:20 -0500

homelab-domain-admin (0.1.31) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Install-time HA automation (always-behind-HAProxy signer). debconf:
    key_encryption_key (auto-generate + print if blank; fixes the never-
    substituted KEK placeholder), haproxy_vip (registry.host = VIP), and
    runtime/migrate role+password (reuse pool creds when an additional
    signer cannot bootstrap its already-existing DB role). postinst now
    ships an nftables.d firewall drop-in and self-registers this host as an
    HAProxy backend + into PowerDNS api_allow_from on EVERY configure
    (idempotent, decoupled from first-install), reading targets from the
    written config. postrm removes the drop-in.

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 08:49:20 -0500

