homelab-domain-admin (0.1.29) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Install-time HA automation: debconf key_encryption_key (auto-generate +
    print if blank; fixes the never-substituted KEK placeholder) and
    haproxy_vip (registry.host = VIP, always-behind-HAProxy). postinst ships
    an nftables.d firewall drop-in and self-registers this host as an HAProxy
    backend + into PowerDNS api_allow_from (local/manual tiers). postrm
    removes the drop-in.

